        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FCA12, 12 Inch Friction Window Stay</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe FCA12 Window Casement Stay has a closed length of 12-7/16\" with an extension of 6-5/8\". Casement stay adjusters hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. There is no need to tighten any knobs on this casement window adjuster because the arm extends to the required position and holds the window open using friction. This is particularly good for those who have a hard time operating the small knobs that work other casement stays. This 12\" Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass for lasting quality, manufactured by <a href=\"/collections/deltana\">Deltana</a>. It is available in 8 high quality finishes. Comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FCA12-Specifications.gif?v=1704354773\" width=\"600\" height=\"226\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FCA12 Contemporary Window Casement Stay Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FCA12 Contemporary Window Stay:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Rod Length: 12-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Extension: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Sash Plate: 1-3/4\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Sill Plate: 1-3/4\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FCA12.pdf?v=1704262163\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  FCA12 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Friction Window Casement Stay Adjuster, Deltana FCA12",
                "description": "12 Inch Contemporary Window Casement Stay Deltana FCA12 - The FCA12 Window Casement Stay has a closed length of 12-7/16 inches with an extension of 6-5/8 inches. Casement stay adjusters hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. There is no need to tighten any knobs on this casement window adjuster because the arm extends to the required position and holds the window open using friction. This is particularly good for those who have a hard time operating the small knobs that work other casement stays. This 12 inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass for lasting quality, manufactured by Deltana. It is available in 8 high quality finishes. Comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n",
